## IAM & Security
- Use service accounts for identity-based access — never service account key files
- Prefer Workload Identity Federation for CI/CD pipelines
- `{{PRIVATE_ENDPOINT_PATTERN}}` — use Private Service Connect for private connectivity
- Enable CMEK (`kms_key_name`) by default where supported
- Use `prevent_destroy = true` lifecycle on stateful resources (GCS buckets, Cloud SQL instances)

## Labels vs Tags
GCP uses `labels` (not `tags`). Merge pattern:
```hcl
locals {
  labels = merge(var.env_default_labels, var.labels)
}
```

## No hardcoded secrets, project IDs, or credentials in module code. Use Workload Identity and Secret Manager.
